SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, ALL LEVELS Vinyasa Flow\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\nJoin us for a slower vinyasa flow to y
 in practice ending in savasana. Join our community and meet other like-min
 ded people! Yoga heals. Nature heals. Yoga In Nature™.\n\nBEGINNERS WELC
 OME AND MODIFICATIONS PROVIDED.\n\nPractice vinyasa flow to yin yoga at No
 rth Carolina Museum of Art\, outdoors near upper parking area in grass ell
 ipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other groups that use NCM
 A grounds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE TO WHERE THE TWO PA
 RKING LOTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET\, AWAY FROM THE MUSEUM. We practice in the g
 rass Ellipse area:)\n$15/person\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-Genander (0862)\nPay
 pal dgenander@yogainnature.com\nZelle\n\nCome flow with us. Meet others an
 d make friends in our yoga community.\nBring a mat or towel for the ground
 \; water\; sunscreen\; and anything else you may need for your outdoor yog
 a practice. You may also want a plastic liner for under your mat\, if the 
 grass is damp.\nALL LEVELS WELCOME.
